+Decision: Canon v0.25.6 [A11Y-01] **Contrast floors (1.4.3/1.4.11)**
+(*Web Content Accessibility Guidelines 2.2*, SC 1.4.3;
+*The WebAIM Million*, 2026), B. Source-palette calculations pass; rendered
